---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Project from "../components/Project.astro";
const pageTitle = "Projects";
---

<style>
  #projects {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
</style>
<BaseLayout {pageTitle}>
  <p>
    My projects are hosted on GitHub. For a VCS, I started with git (using GitHub Desktop 💩). I
    transitioned to interacting with git solely through the command line. I won't pretend I know how
    to use git like crazy. I've since been introduced to (and really enjoy) jujutsu (hereafter
    referred to as "jj").
  </p>
  <div id="projects">
    <Project
      name="Personal Website"
      href="https://github.com/DemetriusSemanko/DemetriusSemanko.github.io"
      desc="This project led to the very site you read from right now! I began with just HTML and CSS.
    I quickly realized I needed some kind of SSG. Starting with Jekyll gave me some
    idea of what to do. My friend eventually convinced me to use Astro. I have enjoyed working on this project.
    I am hosting my code on both GitHub and Tangled. I eventually want to deploy my site entirely
    from Tangled."
    />
    <Project
      name="Blackjack"
      href="https://github.com/DemetriusSemanko/Blackjack"
      desc="I tried my best to recreate the game of blackjack. While I originally
          took a crack at it in Java, I am actively working on a Python
          implementation."
    />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
